    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brace yourself for a relentless alien assault in <i><strong>Let Them Come: Onslaught</strong></i>, where bullet heaven gameplay collides with the gritty spirit of retro sci-fi classics.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run challenges you to create the perfect build from an arsenal of over-the-top weapons and explosive upgrades\u2014shredding alien hordes in a display of retro-fueled chaos. If you\u2019re seeking <strong>a survivors-like experience</strong> with a vintage action movie vibe, set to the pulsing beat of a soundtrack by <i><strong>Cartridge 87</strong></i>, this game sets itself apart from the pack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLE WEAPON UNLOCKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unleash your inner action hero with weapons straight out of your favorite sci-fi flick, from flamethrowers to Photon Sabers and more. You can even nuke the site from orbit - it\u2019s the only way to be sure. Each weapon brings a distinct playstyle, and upgrades let you stack up devastating combos. Whether you prefer crowd-clearing firepower, targeted precision, or life-saving shields, you can tailor your loadout for maximum carnage (and maximum style).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEEP REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are ever the same. Between battles, invest your hard-earned rewards to unlock and enhance new skills, refine your strategy, and push deeper into enemy territory. Experimentation is key\u2014try different weapon synergies, combine special effects, and perfect your approach until your unstoppable build leaves nothing but alien rubble in its wake.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FACE ENDLESS HORDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You won\u2019t just fight endless waves, you\u2019ll revel in them. As the alien onslaught intensifies, your reflexes and tactics are put to the test. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll face towering bosses that demand every ounce of skill you\u2019ve honed. It\u2019s the ultimate showdown, straight from the adrenaline-drenched heyday of retro sci-fi action. Gear up, lock \u2018n load, and get ready to Let Them Come, because the Onslaught is about to begin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AN ALL ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every beat fuels the action, whether you\u2019re dodging, blasting, or barely holding the line, the music pushes you deeper into the chaos. Feel the pulse of battle with a synth-driven soundtrack by <strong>Cartridge 87</strong>, designed to keep your adrenaline pumping as the alien horde closes in.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brace yourself for a relentless alien assault in <i><strong>Let Them Come: Onslaught</strong></i>, where bullet heaven gameplay collides with the gritty spirit of retro sci-fi classics.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run challenges you to create the perfect build from an arsenal of over-the-top weapons and explosive upgrades\u2014shredding alien hordes in a display of retro-fueled chaos. If you\u2019re seeking <strong>a survivors-like experience</strong> with a vintage action movie vibe, set to the pulsing beat of a soundtrack by <i><strong>Cartridge 87</strong></i>, this game sets itself apart from the pack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLE WEAPON UNLOCKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/575bc0fa3526003066a81e5e2d403e97.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unleash your inner action hero with weapons straight out of your favorite sci-fi flick, from flamethrowers to Photon Sabers and more. You can even nuke the site from orbit - it\u2019s the only way to be sure. Each weapon brings a distinct playstyle, and upgrades let you stack up devastating combos. Whether you prefer crowd-clearing firepower, targeted precision, or life-saving shields, you can tailor your loadout for maximum carnage (and maximum style).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEEP REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/d6bc3a6771218374310419704df95049.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are ever the same. Between battles, invest your hard-earned rewards to unlock and enhance new skills, refine your strategy, and push deeper into enemy territory. Experimentation is key\u2014try different weapon synergies, combine special effects, and perfect your approach until your unstoppable build leaves nothing but alien rubble in its wake.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FACE ENDLESS HORDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/4ede1527706ab9016ef3e81adc4ce656.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You won\u2019t just fight endless waves, you\u2019ll revel in them. As the alien onslaught intensifies, your reflexes and tactics are put to the test. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll face towering bosses that demand every ounce of skill you\u2019ve honed. It\u2019s the ultimate showdown, straight from the adrenaline-drenched heyday of retro sci-fi action. Gear up, lock \u2018n load, and get ready to Let Them Come, because the Onslaught is about to begin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AN ALL ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.poster.avif?t=1745943137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.webm?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050800/extras/7abbaf521097720ffd8d8d75bc1d2ecd.mp4?t=1745943137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every beat fuels the action, whether you\u2019re dodging, blasting, or barely holding the line, the music pushes you deeper into the chaos. Feel the pulse of battle with a synth-driven soundtrack by <strong>Cartridge 87</strong>, designed to keep your adrenaline pumping as the alien horde closes in.</p>",
